      ],
      "Deliverable Description": "A competitive analysis is a study of what similar products do well and poorly. It gives the team an honest read on the landscape they are entering.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Knowing the competition helps a team find gaps to fill and avoid repeating others' mistakes, so their product can stand out.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "It is done during Discovery and feeds strategy work like positioning statements, the market research analysis, and the product vision.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
