      "Duty Who Owns the Deliverable": [
        {
          "id": "spf:product-management",
          "label": "Product Management"
        }
      ],
      "Deliverable Description": "A market research analysis pulls together what a team learns about its market, customers, and trends. It turns scattered facts into a clear read on the opportunity.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It grounds big decisions in evidence rather than hunches, so a team invests where there is real demand.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Created in Discovery, it informs the business plan, go-to-market plan, and positioning work, and it pairs with the competitive analysis.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
