          "label": "Product Management"
        }
      ],
      "Deliverable Description": "A buyer persona is a profile of the person who decides to purchase a product, which is not always the person who uses it. It captures what drives a buying decision.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It helps the team and business speak to the people who actually pay, shaping pricing, messaging, and sales.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Built in Discovery, it complements user personas and feeds the marketing plan, positioning, and go-to-market work.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
