      "Deliverable Description": "KPIs are the handful of numbers a team watches to know whether a product is succeeding, like sign-ups or retention. They are the scoreboard for the goals that matter.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Clear KPIs keep a team honest about progress and help everyone agree on what winning actually looks like.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Set during Intake alongside goals and OKRs, they guide decisions across the whole project and show up again in analytics and testing.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Agile Coach, with guides on agile, Scrum, and Kanban: https://www.atlassian.com/agile",
