      "Deliverable Description": "A roadmap is a high-level view of where a product is going and roughly when. It shows the major themes and milestones without locking in every detail.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It keeps everyone pointed the same way and helps stakeholders see the plan, while leaving room to adjust as the team learns.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Shaped in the Vision milestone, it sits above scope, epics, and the release plan and gets revisited as priorities evolve.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
