      "Deliverable Description": "A high-fidelity prototype looks and behaves close to the finished product, with real design and interactions. It is the most realistic preview before development.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It gives testers and stakeholders a true feel for the product, catching issues while they are still easy and cheap to fix.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "It builds on low-fidelity prototypes in Implement and hands developers a clear target, backed by UI specs and the design system.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/",
      "Hand-Off Deliverables Map": [
        {
          "id": "spf:part-3-the-outcomes",
          "label": "Part 3: The outcomes"
        }
      ]
    },
