        }
      ],
      "Deliverable Description": "A customer experience diagram maps the full relationship a customer has with a product or company, across every touchpoint. It zooms out beyond a single journey to the whole picture.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It helps a team see the experience as a connected whole, so improvements in one place do not create problems in another.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Made in Discovery or Implement, it builds on journey maps and personas and guides strategy across many milestones.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/",
      "Hand-Off Deliverables Map": [
