      "Deliverable Description": "A research plan lays out what a team wants to learn, how they will study it, and who they will talk to. It is the blueprint for a piece of research.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Planning first keeps research focused and trustworthy, so the team gets clear answers instead of a muddle.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Created early in Discovery, it sets up the research activities that lead to reports, personas, and other findings.",
