      "Deliverable Description": "A design system is a shared library of reusable design pieces, patterns, and rules for a product. It is the toolkit that keeps a product consistent.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It lets designers and developers build faster and more consistently, since they reuse trusted parts instead of remaking them.",
