      "Deliverable Description": "A copywriting document holds the written words that go into a product or its marketing, drafted and organized in one place. It is where the product's language lives before it ships.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Good copy guides and persuades users, and keeping it in one document keeps the voice consistent and easy to review.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Produced in Implement from the editorial style guide, it feeds the microcopy and content that appear throughout the product.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
