      "Deliverable Description": "An analytics audit reviews the data a product collects to check that it is accurate and actually useful. It makes sure the team is measuring the right things well.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Trustworthy data is the basis for good decisions, so an audit keeps the team from acting on numbers that quietly mislead.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Done in Discovery or Acceptance Testing, it supports the research analysis and the KPIs the team tracks.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
