      "Deliverable Description": "A taxonomy is the system of labels and categories a product uses to organize its content. It is the naming and grouping scheme behind the scenes.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Consistent, sensible categories help users and the product itself find and connect the right things.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Created in Implement alongside the sitemap while shaping information architecture, it supports search, navigation, and content.",
