      "Deliverable Description": "A positioning statement sums up what a product is, who it is for, and why it is different, in a sentence or two. It is the north star for how a product presents itself.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "A clear position helps everyone tell a consistent story and helps customers instantly grasp why the product is for them.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Shaped in Discovery from research and competitive analysis, it feeds the unique value proposition, marketing, and go-to-market work.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
