      "Deliverable Description": "A unique value proposition is a short, sharp statement of the main benefit a product offers that others do not. It answers 'why choose this?'",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It focuses the whole team and message on the one thing that matters most to customers, cutting through the noise.",
