        {
          "id": "spf:ux-user-experience-writing",
          "label": "UX (User Experience) Writing"
        }
      ],
      "Deliverable Description": "Microcopy is the tiny bits of text scattered through a product: button labels, error messages, hints, and tips. Small as it is, it guides people at every step.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "The right microcopy can make a confusing moment feel simple, while the wrong words leave people stuck. It quietly shapes the whole experience.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Written in Implement from the copywriting document and style guide, it works alongside the designs and content it lives inside.",
