      "Deliverable Description": "Research analysis is the work of making sense of research data to find what it really means. It is where raw input becomes insight.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Careful analysis keeps a team from jumping to conclusions, so decisions rest on what the data actually shows.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Done in Discovery and Acceptance Testing across many activities, it feeds research reports, personas, and the team's priorities.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/",
