      "Deliverable Description": "Working agreements are the ground rules a team sets for how they will work together, from meeting norms to how they handle disagreement. The team writes their own social contract.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Agreed norms head off friction and confusion, so the team spends energy on the work instead of on avoidable conflict.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Created during Intake, they pair with the team charter and RACI chart to set up healthy collaboration from the start.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Team Playbook, practical plays for healthy teamwork: https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook"
    },
