      "Deliverable Description": "A product-market fit analysis checks how well a product satisfies a real market need. It gauges whether the product truly resonates with its audience.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Finding fit is often the difference between a product that grows and one that stalls, so this analysis guides big strategic calls.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Done in Discovery from positioning and market research, it informs the business, marketing, and go-to-market plans.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
