      "Deliverable Description": "Technical architecture specifications are the detailed rules for how a system will be built: the technologies, structures, and standards. They turn an architecture diagram into build-ready detail.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Clear specs keep developers building consistently and prevent shaky technical foundations that cause trouble later.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Created in Requirements from the system architecture diagram, they guide the Implement milestone and the diagrams that support it.",
