      ],
      "Deliverable Description": "Brand archetypes are familiar personality types, like the hero or the caregiver, used to give a brand a clear character. They are a shortcut to a consistent brand personality.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Choosing an archetype helps a team make the brand feel human and coherent across everything it says and shows.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Defined in Implement as part of brand identity, they guide the voice, copy, and visuals the team creates.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/",
      "Hand-Off Deliverables Map": [
