      "Deliverable Description": "An entity relationship diagram maps out the data a product stores and how the pieces relate, like users and their orders. It is a blueprint for a database.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Getting the data structure right early prevents tangled, error-prone databases that are painful to fix later.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Created in Requirements, it guides the database architecture and the developers who build the data layer.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "MDN Web Docs, a trusted resource for building software: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn"
    },
