      "Deliverable Description": "Stakeholder feedback is the input gathered from the people invested in a product, like clients, users, and leaders. It captures what the people who matter think.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Listening to stakeholders keeps the work aligned with real needs and expectations, and it builds the trust a project runs on.",
