      "Deliverable Description": "QA analysis is the review of testing results to judge whether a product is ready and where it still falls short. It weighs the evidence testing produced.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "It gives the team a clear, honest verdict on quality, so they launch with confidence instead of crossed fingers.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Done in Launch and Acceptance Testing from QA testing, it builds on test plans and cases and informs the go or no-go call.",
