      "Deliverable Description": "A project goals definition states what a project is trying to achieve in clear terms. It is the shared answer to 'what does success look like?'",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Agreed goals keep everyone rowing the same way and give the team a way to judge whether they are on track.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Set in Intake, it anchors the statement of work, KPIs, and OKRs and guides decisions across the whole project.",
