      "Deliverable Description": "Database architecture is the design of how a product stores, organizes, and connects its data. It is the structure behind everything the product remembers.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "A well-designed database keeps a product fast and reliable and prevents messy data problems that are costly to untangle.",
