      "Deliverable Description": "Kanban board statuses are the columns work moves through on a board, like To Do, Doing, and Done. They show the state of every piece of work at a glance.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Clear statuses make a team's flow visible, so bottlenecks are easy to spot and nothing quietly stalls.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Defined in Intake while setting up the team's process, they support how the team tracks work across every sprint.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Team Playbook, practical plays for healthy teamwork: https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook"
    },
