      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Written in Implement through blockchain coding, they are a specialized part of the product's code.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "MDN Web Docs, a trusted resource for building software: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn"
    },
