      "Deliverable Description": "An SEO strategy is a plan for helping a product or site show up when people search for it online. It is about being findable, not just good.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Even great content helps no one if it cannot be found, so this strategy connects the product to the people looking for it.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Built in Implement through SEO design and optimization, it works with content, taxonomy, and the marketing plan.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
