      "Deliverable Description": "An agile method is the specific approach a team chooses for working in an agile way, such as Scrum or Kanban. It is the framework the team's rhythm follows.",
      "Why Is This Deliverable Important?": "Picking a method that fits the team gives everyone a shared, proven way to plan, build, and improve together.",
      "How Does This Deliverable Relate to Other Deliverables?": "Chosen in Intake, it shapes the team's process, ceremonies, and many of the other deliverables the team produces.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Team Playbook, practical plays for healthy teamwork: https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook"
    },
